      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "15th May (Thu): Ms. Iyer runs the\npayment run (1st and 15th) and\nuploads the file for the student-\ndeposit account to internet\nbanking. Mr. Batra is the only\nsignatory on that account; he is\non leave until 20th May",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "acc2",
      "originalText": "15th May (Thu): Ms. Iyer runs the payment run (1st and 15th) and uploads the file for the student- deposit account to internet banking. Mr. Batra is the only signatory on that account; he is on leave until 20th May",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
